flowchart TB
  classDef actor fill:#231126,stroke:#f43f5e,color:#fff,stroke-width:1px
  classDef control fill:#40102a,stroke:#fb7185,color:#fff,stroke-width:1px
  classDef boundary fill:#10243d,stroke:#67e8f9,color:#e6f7ff,stroke-width:1px
  classDef system fill:#17242d,stroke:#34d399,color:#eafdf4,stroke-width:1px
  classDef optional fill:#312716,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#fff8dc,stroke-dasharray: 5 4
  classDef evidence fill:#231d3b,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#f5f3ff,stroke-width:1px

  subgraph Users[Enterprise users and operations]
    direction LR
    Admin[Security administrators]:::actor
    Operator[Enterprise operators]:::actor
    Approver[Authorized approvers]:::actor
    SOC[SOC / compliance team]:::actor
  end

  subgraph Runtime[Integrated AI-agent execution paths]
    direction LR
    Cloud[Cloud agent<br/>signed runtime SDK]:::boundary
    Browser[Managed browser agent<br/>wrapper / extension / RPA adapter]:::boundary
    MCP[MCP-capable agent<br/>signed runtime credential]:::boundary
  end

  subgraph AgentFence[AgentFence governed action path]
    direction TB
    Registry[Agent Registry & workload identity<br/>tenant · owner · environment · risk]:::control
    Gateway[Tool Gateway<br/>signed identity · nonce/replay check<br/>one decision per integrated action]:::control
    MCPGateway[Native MCP Gateway<br/>public HTTPS discovery · trust · proxy<br/>per-tool runtime scope]:::control
    Guard[Data Guard<br/>inbound + outbound inspection<br/>strongest sensitivity + redaction]:::control
    Policy[Policy Engine<br/>tool · action · parameters · data · destination]:::control
    Approval[Human Approval Workflow<br/>high-impact action holds]:::control
    Broker[Credential Broker<br/>scoped runtime credential lifecycle]:::control
    Monitor[Runtime Monitoring & Notifications<br/>allow · block · approval · outcome]:::evidence
    Ledger[Tamper-Evident Audit Ledger<br/>decisions · changes · approvals · outcomes]:::evidence
    Owasp[Controlled OWASP assessment<br/>synthetic policy-path test only<br/>no external payload execution]:::optional
    Registry --> Gateway --> Guard --> Policy
    MCPGateway --> Guard
    Policy -->|allow| Broker
    Policy -->|approval required| Approval -->|approved action| Broker
    Owasp -. tests same policy boundary .-> Policy
    Gateway -->|all decisions| Monitor
    Approval -->|approval / rejection| Monitor
    Gateway --> Ledger
    Guard --> Ledger
    Policy --> Ledger
    Approval --> Ledger
    Broker --> Ledger
    Monitor --> Ledger
  end

  subgraph Targets[Approved target and evidence boundaries]
    direction LR
    APIs[Cloud APIs / internal services<br/>CRM · ERP · databases · SaaS]:::system
    Portal[Approved browser portals<br/>existing enterprise browser session]:::system
    Vault[Customer HashiCorp Vault AppRole<br/>optional customer activation]:::optional
    SIEM[SIEM / SOAR / evidence export<br/>optional configured delivery]:::optional
  end

  Admin -->|register agent and policy| Registry
  Operator -->|integrated action intent| Cloud
  Operator -->|integrated browser intent| Browser
  Cloud --> Gateway
  Browser --> Gateway
  MCPServer[Customer-approved remote MCP server<br/>public HTTPS only<br/>STDIO/private/OAuth/streaming excluded]:::optional
  MCP -->|runtime-scoped tools/call| MCPGateway
  MCPGateway -->|reviewed tool invocation| MCPServer
  Broker -->|scoped target call| APIs
  Vault -. customer-connected lease/read only after activation .-> Broker
  Gateway -->|browser action allowed only| Portal
  Browser -. executes with existing browser session;<br/>no brokered target credential .-> Portal
  APIs -->|sanitized outcome report| Monitor
  Portal -->|sanitized outcome report| Monitor
  Ledger -. configured export / evidence packet .-> SIEM
  SOC -->|review evidence and alerts| Monitor
  SOC -->|review export| SIEM
